{"parse": {"title": "Spooky Star", "pageid": 5329, "revid": 39255, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/6b/Spooky_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20231116115440\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Spooky Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/6b/Spooky_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20231116115440\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"185\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Spooky Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Spooky_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Spooky_Star.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>​\n</p><p>The <b>Spooky Star</b> is a new obtainable item introduced in the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Halloween 2023</a> update which can be bought for 150 Candy from the Navi NPC next to spawn!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Inside the <b>Spooky Star</b>, you can discover 4 new exclusive units and 14 different Halloween themed skins!</li>\n<li>If you haven't received a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> after 400 <b>Spooky Stars</b>, you will get one guaranteed!</li>\n<li>Alucard is not obtainable through <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> pity.</li>\n<li>The 4 exclusive units are Hido, Hinamy, Gas, and the secret unit Alucard.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Star_Chances\">Star Chances</span></h2>\n<div style=\"font-family: &#39;Fredoka One&#39;,rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #0d8cff;\">Rare Skin: 81.5%</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #7c04f5;\">Epic Skin: 16.0%</span></li>\n<li>⭐<span style=\"color: #ffc71e;\">Legendary Skin: 2.0%</span></li>\n<li>💀<span style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mythic Skin: 0.25%<span class=\"Tsh(Game) mobile-hidden\" style=\"position: absolute; z-index: -1; left: 0;\">Mythical</span></span></li>\n<li>🎃<span style=\"color: #e01419;\">Mythic Unit: 0.25%</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Units\">Obtainable Units</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Secret)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dracula\" title=\"Dracula\"><img alt=\"Dracula\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/8f/Dracula.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250823173035\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dracula.png\" data-image-key=\"Dracula.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text Fz(90%)\">Dracula</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Mythic)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gas\" title=\"Gas\"><img alt=\"Gas\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/78/Gas.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250416203816\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gas.png\" data-image-key=\"Gas.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Gas</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Hinamy.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Hinamy.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Hinamy.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Hinamy</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Hido.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Hido.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Hido.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Hido</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Skins\">Obtainable Skins</span></h2>\n<p>Mythical Skins and Units give a 40% each, Legendary Skins give 25%, Epic Skin give 5%, and Rare Skins give 2% of Event Boost and Secret Units Chance. However they also boost damage and event currency drop rate depends on skins. Please note that these stats boost only works on Event.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skins_obtainable_from_the_Spooky_Star_capsule\"><center>Skins obtainable from the Spooky Star capsule</center></span></h3>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Unit\n</th>\n<th>Buff\n</th></tr><tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/67/Zoru_halloween_cosmetic.png/revision/latest?cb=20231102060513\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Zoru halloween cosmetic\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"298\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Zoru halloween cosmetic.png\" data-image-key=\"Zoru_halloween_cosmetic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/67/Zoru_halloween_cosmetic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20231102060513\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><center></center></td>\n<td><ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\"><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div clas